<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Millipore Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Millipore lost 12/16 to 41-7/16.</p>
</text>
